\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  Onward go, onward go!\cf0 
\par Onward, Zion, walk in light!
\par Let your light be clearly burning,
\par full of first love, gleaming bright
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Spring of life will still your yearning
\par Zion, strive the narrow gate to know.
\par Onward go onward go!
\par Onward, Zion, Walk in light.
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  Still endure, still endure
\par Zion, bear the scorn and pain.
\par Thr'o all sorrows fear and anguish,
\par your faith shall not be in vain.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Bearers of the crown shall vanquished
\par tho' it seems the goal's not always sure,
\par still endure, still endure,
\par Zion, bear the scorn and pain.
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0\qj 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  Onward strive, onward strive
\par Zion onward strive with might.
\par When your brother love is burning,
\par serving Christ is your delight,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par He'll be for His Bride returning
\par Zion heaven's door now opened wide!
\par Onward strive, onward strive!
\par \pard    Zion onward strive with might.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

